<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1A) An incentive scheme referred to in paragraphs (1)(m) and (n) shall be the incentive scheme for a qualifying activity prescribed by the Minister which includes— (a) any high technology activity in manufacturing and services sector; and (b) any other activities which would benefit the economy of Malaysia.”. New section 6d"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/eng@> .
