<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_56__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (1A) the following subsection: “(1b) For the purposes of subsection (1A)— (a) the chargeable profits shall be the net profits as reflected in the audited accounts in respect of such Labuan business activity of the Labuan entity for the basis period for that year of assessment; and (b) sections 6, 6A, 6b, 6C, 6d, 8 and 8A shall apply, with necessary modifications.”. Amendment of section 3a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/eng@> .
