<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/eng@/~chp_V__cl_53> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 49(3) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “48(4) or (5)” the words “48(4), (5) or (6)”. New section 71b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/eng@> .
